@baseUrl = http://localhost:5180
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Login admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/SGR/AuthService/GenerateToken
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "REEMPLAZAR",
  "password": "REEMPLAZAR"
}

### Morosos (sin filtro)
GET {{baseUrl}}/Reports/Reportes/Morosos
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Morosos por período
GET {{baseUrl}}/Reports/Reportes/Morosos?mes=10&anio=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Error: mes sin anio
GET {{baseUrl}}/Reports/Reportes/Morosos?mes=9
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
